        <p>Czekamy na Ciebie. Zaglądaj na Instagrama po aktualne smaki i promocje.</p>
        <div class="info-rows">
          <div class="info-row"><span class="info-icon">📍</span><div><p class="info-label">Adres</p><p class="info-val">ul. 1 Maja 16A, 59-300 Lubin</p></div></div>
          <div class="info-row"><span class="info-icon">📞</span><div><p class="info-label">Telefon</p><p class="info-val"><a href="tel:+48691636835" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">691 636 835</a></p></div></div>
          <div class="info-row"><span class="info-icon">🕐</span><div>
